  "title": "Imran Khan's Detention in India Amid Protests",
  "summary": "Actor Imran Khan, a US citizen, was detained in Mumbai after participating in a protest against the Chief Election Commissioner, prompting a legal notice to leave India by October 28. His detention highlights ongoing political tensions in India.",
